      "writtenOn": "2021-02-24T10:54:56Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "You already got +2 from Chris, so feel free to ignore - but for better attribution of performance / memory impact of the native loop, it\u0027d be nice to separate this CL into two: one that refactors the code so that it makes it possible to have a native loop, and one that implements the native loop. WDYT?",
